@startuml 已注册学生用例图
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #2E7D32
skinparam actorBorderColor #2E7D32
skinparam arrowColor #2E7D32
skinparam usecaseFontSize 14
skinparam actorFontSize 14
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

top to bottom direction

actor "已注册学生" as Student

usecase "登录登出" as UC1
usecase "浏览商品列表" as UC2
usecase "搜索筛选商品" as UC3
usecase "查看商品详情" as UC4
usecase "发布二手商品" as UC5
usecase "管理我的商品" as UC6
usecase "加入购物车" as UC7
usecase "提交订单" as UC8
usecase "在线支付" as UC9
usecase "查看订单状态" as UC10
usecase "确认收货" as UC11
usecase "担保交易" as UC12
usecase "收藏商品" as UC13
usecase "私信卖家" as UC14
usecase "评价商品" as UC15
usecase "修改个人信息" as UC16
usecase "选择自提点" as UC17
usecase "查看公告" as UC18

Student --> UC1
Student --> UC2
Student --> UC5
Student --> UC7
Student --> UC8
Student --> UC13
Student --> UC14
Student --> UC16
Student --> UC18

UC3 ..> UC2 : <<extend>>
UC4 ..> UC2 : <<extend>>
UC6 ..> UC5 : <<extend>>
UC9 ..> UC8 : <<include>>
UC11 ..> UC10 : <<extend>>
UC12 ..> UC8 : <<extend>>
UC15 ..> UC11 : <<extend>>

note bottom of Student : 已登录学生可执行的操作
@enduml
